Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dental practices around {City}. {Business Name} has good reviews, but no way for a new patient to book an exam at night or see which dental plans you bill directly before they call.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: new-patient booking by provider, a benefits and fees page, an emergency dentist page with after-hours steps, a page for nervous patients and a kids' first visit page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain your practice owns and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. You approve every page, and nothing on it promises a treatment result. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
